.TH DOLPHIN-CONVERT-ACTIONS 1 "July 2026" "dolphin-convert-actions 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dolphin-convert-actions \- Smart context-menu media converter for Dolphin file manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dolphin-convert-actions
[\fI\,--smart-menu\/\fR] [\fI\,--batch MODE\/\fR] [\fI\,--format FMT\/\fR]
[\fI\,--configure\/\fR] [\fI\,files...\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBdolphin-convert-actions\fR is the backend for Dolphin (KDE file manager)
service menus that add intelligent, context-aware media conversion actions
to the right-click menu.
.PP
It detects the MIME type of the selected file and presents only relevant
conversion options via kdialog dialogs, then runs the chosen conversion
using ffmpeg with real-time progress tracking.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-smart-menu\fR
Show the interactive smart menu. Detects file type and presents relevant
conversion actions. This is the mode called by the service menu.
.TP
\fB\-\-batch\fR \fI\,MODE\/\fR
Run a batch conversion without interactive menus. Supported modes:
.RS
.TP
\fBaudio\fR
Convert audio files (use \fB\-\-format\fR to specify target).
.TP
\fBvideo\-to\-gif\fR
Convert video files to animated GIF.
.TP
\fBvideo\-to\-mp4\fR
Transcode video to MP4 (H.264+AAC).
.TP
\fBvideo\-to\-webm\fR
Transcode video to WebM (VP9+Opus).
.TP
\fBextract\-audio\fR
Extract audio track from video to MP3.
.TP
\fBimgur\-upload\fR
Upload images/GIFs/videos to Imgur.
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI\,FMT\/\fR
Target format for \fB\-\-batch audio\fR. One of: mp3, ogg, flac, wav, m4a,
opus, alac.
.TP
\fB\-\-configure\fR
Open the configuration dialog to set defaults (audio format, GIF preset,
Imgur Client ID).
.TP
\fBfiles\fR
One or more file paths to process. Supports %F and %f from Dolphin service
menu substitution.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.IP 0
All conversions completed successfully.
.IP 1
One or more errors occurred or the operation was cancelled.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/dolphin-convert-actions/config.json\fR
User configuration file. Stores default audio format, GIF preset, and
Imgur Client ID.
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/kio/servicemenus/dolphin-convert-actions.desktop\fR
Service menu definition for the smart menu.
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/kio/servicemenus/dolphin-audio-converter.desktop\fR
Service menu definition for the dedicated audio submenu.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Show the smart menu for a GIF file:
dolphin-convert-actions \-\-smart\-menu funny.gif
.TP
Batch convert audio files to FLAC:
dolphin-convert-actions \-\-batch audio \-\-format flac *.wav
.TP
Convert a video to GIF with medium preset:
dolphin-convert-actions \-\-batch video\-to\-gif \-\-format medium clip.mp4
.TP
Upload images to Imgur:
dolphin-convert-actions \-\-batch imgur\-upload screenshot.png
.TP
Open configuration:
dolphin-convert-actions \-\-configure
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.TP
Python 3.10+
.TP
ffmpeg (>= 4.4) with ffprobe
.TP
kdialog (KDE)
.TP
libnotify
